<title>USA: Brazil's Copene Q3 ADR declines to $0.24.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Copene Q3 ADR declines to $0.24.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.24		    $0.53</p>
<p> Net			  8,800		   19,100</p>
<p> Pretax inc		 9,500		   41,600</p>
<p> Revs		     339,300		  374,200</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.29		    $3.33</p>
<p> Net			 46,300		  119,300</p>
<p> Pretax inc		53,600		  187,100</p>
<p> Revs		   1,008,900		1,129,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Copene Petroquimica do Nordeste SA.</p>
<p>The company said results in the third quarter 1996 continued to be affected by high naphtha prices. Also, petrochemical prices increased only modestly, which caused margins to decrease, the company said.</p>
</text>
